## Branches and production permission

This repository has no staging. Create `feat/`, `fix/`, or `chore/` branches from `main` and open PRs explicitly into `main`. Never push directly to `main`. Merging into `main` deploys production and is the only human gate: AI agents give the PR, its scope, checks and production steps and wait for one human yes before merging with a merge commit. No second account or formal approving review is required. See [RELEASE_POLICY.md](RELEASE_POLICY.md) for the environment checks.
